  @.5107 text "The TRACE method requests a remote, application-level loop-back of the request message. The final recipient of the request SHOULD reflect the message received, excluding some fields described below, back to the client as the content of a "
  @.5110 link "200 (OK)" url="/rfc/rfc9110.html#status.200"
  @.5112 text " response. The "message/http" format ("
