  @.6120 text "Note that some recipients treat the order in which language tags are listed as an indication of descending priority, particularly for tags that are assigned equal quality values (no value is the same as q=1). However, this behavior cannot be relied upon. For consistency and to maximize interoperability, many user agents assign each language tag a unique quality value while also listing them in order of decreasing quality. Additional discussion of language priority lists can be found in "
  @.6121 link "Section 2.3" url="/rfc/rfc4647#section-2.3"
  @.6123 text " of ["
